# Focus Tiger · Vite client env template
#
# Copy as needed (gitignored; never commit real values):
#   cp .env.example .env.development
#   cp .env.example .env.production
#
# Isolation rule (SSOT: docs/ENV_CONFIG.md):
#   - Development secrets stay in .env.development / .env.local
#   - Production public config stays in .env.production
#   - Never mix production Secret Keys into development files (or vice versa)
#
# Vite only exposes keys prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.
# NEVER put a cloud Secret Key / private API key in any VITE_* variable —
# those would ship to every client. Server secrets belong in Cloudflare
# Workers secrets / GitHub Actions secrets, not in the Vite client.

# Tip Jar / Sanctuary / Membership · public Worker base (no secrets). Stripe webhook SSOT:
# VITE_CLOUD_API_BASE_URL=https://focus-tiger-cloud.ihiro.workers.dev
# Or copy to .env.local for local Vite.
